# Git sync (trimdrop.ke)

When you change files in this repo under `C:\Users\forst-pov\Desktop\trimdrop.ke` (or workspace root is this folder):

1. Run `git status` in the project root.
2. If there are changes: `git add -A`, then `git commit -m "<clear one-line message>"` describing what changed.
3. Run `git push origin main` (or `git push -u origin main` on first push).

Do not leave the working tree dirty with completed work unless the user asked to hold commits. If push fails (auth, no network), say what failed and what to run locally.
